<title>JAPAN: OSE says Showpla Asia to list on OSE on Aug 29.</title>
<headline>OSE says Showpla Asia to list on OSE on Aug 29.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said on  Friday that Showpla Asia Ltd of Singapore plans to list its shares  on the Osaka bourse on August 29.  </p>
<p>Showpla, an affiliate of Showa Plastics Co Ltd of Japan, will be the  first company to list its shares on the foreign section of the exchange,  industry sources said.</p>
<p>The bourse created the section in October 1996.</p>
<p>At the time of the listing, Showpla Asia will issue 32 million new  shares, the OSE said.</p>
</text>
